      "content": "okay i'll try the antibiotic stuff then. but honestly it's still stinging so much. if i use a really thick layer of something like vaseline or even some coconut oil, wouldn't that act like a better seal to protect the skin so it can just knit back together? like how you use ointment on a regular scrape? it's basically the same thing right?",
